     "tipo": "dialogo",
     "titulo": "Dialogue: telling about a decision",
     "frases": [
      {
       "quien": {
        "texto": "林娜",
        "lengua": "estudio"
       },
       "estudio": "谈到「个人选择」，你觉得哪一个选择最重要？",
       "alumno": "When talking about «personal decisions», which decision seems most important to you?",
       "literal": "",
       "estructura": "",
       "nota": [],
       "analisis": [],
       "parrafo": 0
      },
      {
       "quien": {
        "texto": "王明",
        "lengua": "estudio"
       },
       "estudio": "我认为这个办法可行，不过还需要考虑具体条件。",
       "alumno": "I think this solution is feasible, although we need to consider the specific conditions.",
       "literal": "",
       "estructura": "",
       "nota": [],
       "analisis": [],
       "parrafo": 0
      },
      {
       "quien": {
        "texto": "林娜",
        "lengua": "estudio"
       },
       "estudio": "你最担心哪一部分？",
       "alumno": "Which part worries you most?",
       "literal": "",
       "estructura": "",
       "nota": [],
       "analisis": [],
       "parrafo": 0
      },
      {
       "quien": {
        "texto": "王明",
        "lengua": "estudio"
       },
       "estudio": "如果时间不够，原来的安排可能就不合适。",
       "alumno": "If time is short, the original plan may not be suitable.",
       "literal": "",
       "estructura": "",
       "nota": [],
       "analisis": [],
       "parrafo": 0
      },
      {
       "quien": {
        "texto": "林娜",
        "lengua": "estudio"
       },
       "estudio": "那我们能不能准备一个替代方案？",
       "alumno": "Then can we prepare an alternative?",
       "literal": "",
       "estructura": "",
       "nota": [],
       "analisis": [],
       "parrafo": 0
      },
      {
       "quien": {
        "texto": "王明",
        "lengua": "estudio"
       },
       "estudio": "可以，同时说明每种选择的利弊。",
       "alumno": "Yes; at the same time, we'll explain the pros and cons of each option.",
       "literal": "",
       "estructura": "",
       "nota": [],
       "analisis": [],
       "parrafo": 0
      }
     ]
    },
    {
     "tipo": "texto",
     "titulo": "Reading: telling about a decision",
     "frases": [
      {
       "quien": {
        "texto": "",
        "lengua": "alumno"
       },
       "estudio": "谈到「个人选择」，每个人的经历和选择都不一样。",
       "alumno": "In «personal decisions», each person's experiences and choices are different.",
       "literal": "",
       "estructura": "",
       "nota": [],
       "analisis": [],
       "parrafo": 0
      },
      {
       "quien": {
        "texto": "",
        "lengua": "alumno"
       },
       "estudio": "回顾一段经历时，既要看当时的条件，也要看后来作出的决定。",
       "alumno": "When looking back on an experience, it's worth considering both the conditions at the time and the decisions made afterwards.",
       "literal": "",
       "estructura": "",
       "nota": [],
       "analisis": [],
       "parrafo": 0
      },
      {
       "quien": {
        "texto": "",
        "lengua": "alumno"
       },
       "estudio": "提出解决办法时，还要考虑它会影响哪些人以及需要哪些资源。",
       "alumno": "When proposing a solution, you must also consider who it will affect and what resources it requires.",
       "literal": "",
       "estructura": "",
       "nota": [],
       "analisis": [],
       "parrafo": 0
      },
      {
       "quien": {
        "texto": "",
        "lengua": "alumno"
       },
       "estudio": "清楚的结论要回应问题，并以具体细节为依据。",
       "alumno": "A clear conclusion answers the question and is based on concrete details.",
       "literal": "",
       "estructura": "",
       "nota": [],
       "analisis": [],
       "parrafo": 0
      }
     ]
    }
